// title: Top 10 devices with the most Critical and High vulnerabilities · Defender XDR
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender for Endpoint
// tables: DeviceTvmSoftwareVulnerabilities
// purpose: Top 10 devices with the most Critical and High vulnerabilities · Defender XDR
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Vulnerability%20Management/Top-Devices-Most-Vulnerabilities.md
